      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念支持度投票的结果……由我拔得头筹！\n我即刻召开表明出赛决心的记者会──",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c645ef813eadd4267c9488b7a128206de6b8cd987460009cae1259bcb1617d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
