    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e6efdc9cfdec069292ed528",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只见会场──人山人海！！\n没想到……因为追寻我这个美的化身，\n而掌握到幸福的人有这么多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69cc7597fc96539bafe620ace4cf811d01a01896352b29ddf123efb3ade252cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
