      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后……我并没有忘记。\n与我一同步向王座，引导我前进的重要人物。\n──对，就是你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8da2679ee9e5520feed4ef2503a9cac2ca004bf4536bc58617b71cce1df5949",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015405.json",
