    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b09fbde6e9065dc03323b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于你的奉献，我立下了誓言，\n将在“有马纪念”赢得胜利，从那个王座──\n将最佳训练员的荣耀颁发给你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3fab9db1eb4e8eb9a3ae770089cdf278c7bc9f7dcd3d4bdf40df4fa33394e0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
